 research"},{"text":"Statutory interpretation"},{"text":"Policy research"},{"text":"Evidence analysis"},{"text":"Government-document research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Impact"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community engagement"},{"text":"Legal aid"},{"text":"Rights awareness"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal research platforms"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Digital evidence"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Privacy awareness"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"LL.B."},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Constitutional Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Civil Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Administrative Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Human Rights"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Environmental / Social Justice Law"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Writ Jurisdiction"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"PIL Principles"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Bare Act Mastery"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Case-Law Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Legal Drafting"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Judicial Review"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Evidence & Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Policy Research"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Courtroom Advocacy"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Community Legal Work"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Legal Ethics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital & AI Literacy"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Public-Interest Litigation Internship"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Constitutional + Civil Law Foundation","Human Rights / Administrative Law","Legal Aid & NGO Exposure","Case-Law Research","Writ & PIL Drafting","Litigation Internship","Courtroom Advocacy","Public-Interest Litigation Practice","Public Interest Litigator","Senior Public Law / Constitutional Law Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest profile is not simply “a lawyer interested in social issues.” It is a lawyer who can identify a legally actionable public problem, verify the facts, establish maintainability, research constitutional/statutory law, build an evidence-backed case, draft effective pleadings and advocate for an appropriate remedy while maintaining professional ethics and the genuine public-interest character of the matter."}]}]}